      "engine": "semgrep",
      "engines": [
        "semgrep"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.888889,
      "call_chain": [],
      "ai_confidence": 0.88,
      "analysis": "第126行 `boolean flag = false;` 使用了语义模糊的变量名 `flag`。该变量用于记录文件删除操作是否成功并作为返回值，应使用更具判断语义的命名如 `deleted` 或 `deleteSuccess`，使代码可读性更好。",
      "enhanced_fix": "boolean deleted = false;\nFile file = new File(filePath);\nif (file.isFile() && file.exists())\n{\n    deleted = file.delete();\n}\nreturn deleted;",
      "is_false_positive": false,
      "needs_review": false,
      "vote": "TP 2/3"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "null-java-collection-get",
      "category": "implementation",
      "severity": "WARNING",
      "file": "ruoyi-common/src/main/java/com/ruoyi/common/utils/http/UserAgentUtils.java",
      "line": 53,
      "end_line": 53,
      "message": "Map.get() 可能返回 null，直接调用方法会导致 NPE。",
      "code_snippet": "requires login",
      "engine": "semgrep",
      "engines": [
        "semgrep"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.888889,
      "call_chain": [],
      "ai_confidence": 0.85,
      "analysis": "iua.get(UserAgent.AGENT_NAME_VERSION) 可能返回 null（当 yauaa 无法识别 UserAgent 中的浏览器信息时），直接调用 .getValue() 将导致 NullPointerException。虽然 yauaa 库在多数情况下返回非 null 值，但缺少防御性空值检查，属于真实的 NPE 风险。",
      "enhanced_fix": "UserAgent.ImmutableUserAgent iua = userAgentAnalyzer.parse(userAgent);\nUserAgent.ImmutableUserAgentField field = iua.get(UserAgent.AGENT_NAME_VERSION);\nString agentNameVersion = (field != null) ? field.getValue() : null;\nif (StringUtils.isBlank(agentNameVersion) || agentNameVersion.contains(\"??\"))\n{\n    return formatBrowser(userAgent);\n}\nreturn agentNameVersion;",
      "is_false_positive": false,
      "needs_review": false,
      "vote": "TP 2/3"
    },
